-- sivol: entry point of every vise (config/scripts/*/*_tiski_repair.ltx). The Old HE repair screen of this name
-- was never ported, so using a vise did nothing; it now goes through sak.repair_on and its choice window
-- (sivol/sivol_vise.script). Without a repair box the usual thought explains why.
function repair_screen()
	if not xr_conditions.actor_has_rep_box() then
		sak.info_rep_box()
		return
	end
	sak.repair_on()
end
